      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En aquellos días Ra ya era viejo. Sus huesos eran de plata, su carne era de oro y su cabello, de lapislázuli puro.",
          "en": "By then Ra had grown old. His bones were silver, his flesh was gold, and his hair was pure lapis lazuli."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los humanos, que habían nacido de su Ojo, empezaron a murmurar a sus espaldas.",
          "en": "The humans, born from his Eye, began to whisper behind his back."
        },
        {
          "es": "Decían que Su Majestad estaba viejo y ya no podía gobernar, y tramaron levantarse contra él.",
          "en": "They said His Majesty was old and could no longer rule, and they plotted to rise against him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero un dios que lo ve todo no tarda en enterarse.",
          "en": "But a god who sees everything is not slow to find out."
        }
      ],
